==== PoE ====
Enabling PoE on switch ports.

<WRAP BOX>
FIXME Please fill in real values for this device, then remove the EXAMPLEs

I installed such packages as kmod-i2c-gpio, kmod-gpio-pca953x, kmod-switch-ar8xxx.

This is the command to enable PoE on the desired port (1):

echo "1" > /sys/class/gpio/ubnt:24v-poe:port1/value

Disabling:

echo "0" > /sys/class/gpio/ubnt:24v-poe:port1/value

To make everything work like new when rebooting, enter the command in /etc/rc.local

</WRAP>


